Value slot (\d+)
Value sensor (\S+)
Value temperature_high_alarm_celsius ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value temperature_high_warning_celsius ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value temperature_celsius ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value sensor_status (\S+)

Start
  ^${slot}\s+${sensor}\s+${temperature_high_alarm_celsius}\s+${temperature_high_warning_celsius}\s+${temperature_celsius}\s+${sensor_status}\s*$$ -> Record
